==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|wonen|wonēn|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|wunaną|lang=gem-pro}}, {{recons|wunēną|lang=gem-pro}}, {{recons|wunajaną||to love, wish|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|wenə-||to wish, love|lang=ine-pro}}. Compare {{etyl|osx|-}} {{term|wunon|lang=osx}} ({{etyl|nds|-}} {{term|wanen|lang=nds}}) , {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|wonen|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|wunian|lang=ang}} ({{etyl|en|-}} {{term|wone|lang=en}}).

